     eps=1e-08   PS = 7.110e-09+5.182e-09j
  edge (2,-1): Lambda = w^2 p2 u^2 + w pm1/u:  claimed +1, corrected 1/3:
     eps=1e-04   PS = 0.333348+0.000000j   (pair found: 2)
     eps=1e-06   PS = 0.333333-0.000000j   (pair found: 2)
     eps=1e-08   PS = 0.333337+0.000006j   (pair found: 2)
  edge (3,-1): Lambda = w^3 p3 u^3 + w pm1/u:  claimed +2/3, corrected 4/9:
